        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"1750fd45-f797-4b7d-b25d-74f037b6c387\",\"review_text\":\"It restricted the no of skips per hour with recent update Unable to go the specific timeline of a song\"},{\"review_id\":\"c28abc2f-5c30-4bcb-b149-cae0b05f562d\",\"review_text\":\"The UI could be improved, that is my main issue with the app and other than that it's great.\"},{\"review_id\":\"1c549305-6b1a-4069-9450-95eb893a9b51\",\"review_text\":\"👌🏻👌🏻\"},{\"review_id\":\"3f3e6d46-79bb-4ee1-ad73-6e92bbf3e5b8\",\"review_text\":\"its a really good music app thought it could tone down the adds a bit\"},{\"review_id\":\"e3a604c9-7016-4c0b-9811-cd5a5657e537\",\"review_text\":\"I felted it an reinstalled it because the app wasn't working properly. Now I cannot even log in. This is a worthless app now. I will not be returning to my premium account ever probably.\"},{\"review_id\":\"cf1076f8-af1e-401f-bb68-b01dd72a6d96\",\"review_text\":\"Good for music lovers\"},{\"review_id\":\"850f326f-dc20-49b9-ba7e-28617af2abe3\",\"review_text\":\"Absolutely brilliant.\"},{\"review_id\":\"eb0d585e-01bd-4389-9d8b-81e2c373a223\",\"review_text\":\"This new irritating all the people\"},{\"review_id\":\"5d7d8547-24cc-4c9f-b105-45738bd04435\",\"review_text\":\"Why doesn't it have original songs like legit Bollywood songs are not available. Why you don't have URI, PARMANU, 3IDOITS , MISSION MANGAL and many more movies songs. Trash app\"},{\"review_id\":\"fa5eba46-75b8-4aba-8efd-a0e47c186906\",\"review_text\":\"i really hate this app so much whats wrong with it like why is shuffle a thing? please remove it its horrible and the ad thing is such a lie i dont get a ad every 30 minutes i get it every 5 minutes spotify please fix your app and make it good!\"}]}"
